#: ../src/iop/cacorrectrgb.c:793
msgid ""
"correction mode to use.\n"
"can help with multiple\n"
"instances for very damaged\n"
"images.\n"
"darken only is particularly\n"
"efficient to correct blue\n"
"chromatic aberration."
